      2  f06b							; Do not edit by hand. C7 (2026-10-20): bank3 async EXTRAS stream —
      3  f06b							; one record per owns-extras room, in room order (the counts byte's
      4  f06b							; b5-0 is the 1-based ORDINAL). Record layout:
      5  f06b							;   +0 flags: n_patches b1-0 | n_features b5-2
      6  f06b							;   +1 MetaA  +2 MetaB  (the retired TilePF0+9/+10 pair — the
      7  f06b							;	loader stages it into $99/$9A)
