     10  f06b							;	  prefix end) | col b3-0
     11  f06b							;   ..   [n_features > 0] 1 B count + 5 B/FEATURE record — the
     12  f06b							;	  live feature geometry ($80 phase cell / $82 hcrunch
     13  f06b							;	  prefix). Static hot + the M1 block cell are derived by
     14  f06b							;	  the loader (PF row 1 + the patch list) — C11.
