   1033  fce9							; --- strip destroyed by a bomb? (EnemyDeadMask b3 — StripBlastCheck
   1034  fce9							; set it this overscan) → blank all band gates so the cave renders no
   1035  fce9							; strip; the pack below then emits mask 0 → every overlay stays
   1036  fce9							; transparent too. BandTab restages from ROM next room entry. ---
   1037  fce9		       a5 ba		      lda	EnemyDeadMask
   1038  fceb		       29 08		      and	#$08
   1039  fced		       f0 08		      beq	.SBTstripAlive
   1040  fcef		       a9 00		      lda	#0
