   1236  ff69							; Record fields ignored (user decision 2026-10-19): the band is always
   1237  ff69							; band 1 and the prefix is always 10 cells. ALWAYS HOT: any overlap of
   1238  ff69							; the player box with the covered prefix kills, at any phase/extent
   1239  ff69							; (the clock animation only moves the covered prefix).
